
@1=~The child of Bhaal has returned! Praise the Lord of Murder, my brothers!~ 
@2=~But who are all these people?~ 
@3=~You really waited for me! And now he's not alone...~ 
@4=~You're the clingy type. I'll get rid of all of you before I leave. It's safer that way!~ 
@5=~I woke my brothers while you were gone.~ 
@6=~(Massena turns to the others) Look, Deathmask, the champion of Bhaal has been revealed. Our high priestess Systera was right!~ 
@7=~(He looks at you again, raising his arms) A great destiny awaits you!~ 
@8=~I certainly intend to. By the way, the trials were a real mess. I hope it's over...~ 
@9=~I will prove myself worthy of this honor. What must I do?~ 
@10=~Find yourselves another champion. I'm sick of this temple. I'm leaving!~ 
@11=~The Grand Master had to make sure you were the chosen one.~ 
@12=~The Grand Master has made you his champion. A great destiny awaits you!~ 
@13=~I will be no one's puppet. Your group of fanatics can find another champion. I'm leaving!~ 
@14=~A great destiny, hmm, I hope it's worth it. What do you expect of me?~ 
@15=~You dare refuse the honor bestowed upon you!~ 
@16=~Oh no, you're not going anywhere...~
@17=~Your place is at the bottom of the well. You will answer for your treachery to the Grand Master!~ 
@18=~We, the Death Masks, must restore the temple. Champion of Bhaal, you may return to the surface. We will contact you very soon.~
@19=~Death masks, let us begin by praying.~ 

// Quest Completion
@200=~Bhaal's Trial Massena is convinced that my presence is not a coincidence. According to him, my father wants me to succeed in his trial as a reward. I accepted his challenge, which awaits me behind this gate.~ 
@201=~Bhaal's Trial Massena is convinced that my presence is not a coincidence. According to him, my father wants me to succeed in his trial as a reward. I refused to accept his challenge, which awaits me behind this gate. Massena took this very badly. The fight is inevitable!~ 
@202=~Bhaal's Trial I faced many dangers and emerged victorious. The murder itself marked me with the symbol of Bhaal on my palm! Upon my return, Massena and his death masks were waiting for me. I am now Bhaal's champion! A great destiny awaits me. Massena will contact me as soon as the temple is restored.~
@203=~The Trial of Bhaal I faced many dangers and emerged victorious. The murder itself marked me with the symbol of Bhaal on my palm! Upon my return, Massena and his death masks were waiting for me. I was fed up with their champion nonsense. I got rid of them.~ 
@204=~The Trial of Bhaal Clearly, the murder itself tested me, and I survived!He marked my palm with the symbol of Bhaal! I don't know where all this will lead...~
